SUMMARY:Fall Forest Ecology Hike
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC to explore the ecology of our fall forests!\nEnjoy the quiet of autumn as we look for hidden habitats\, explore the life cycles of forest creature and look for signs of natural and human impacts on forest life.  This 3 mile moderate hike features some steep inclines and variable terrain. This is a free event\, but pre-registration is required:
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/fall-forest-ecology-hike
LOCATION:Johnston Mill Preserve Secondary Entrance\, 6001 Turkey Farm Rd.\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
END:VEVENT
