SUMMARY:Nature Journaling Hike
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a family friendly nature journaling hike!\nJoin Trail Guide Katie F. for nature journaling that moves beyond the what and the who. Learn to notice\, wonder\, and appreciate life around you like a naturalist. This hike will cover a little less than two miles of two ponds loop and the pine warbler trail as you reflect on the teachings of the natural world. This hike is family friendly\, but it is best suited for ages 5 plus. Please bring paper and a pencil. This is a free hike\, but pre-registration is required.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-journaling-hike
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
