SUMMARY:Get Wild: Nature Detectives!
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a family friendly wildlife scavenger hunt!  \nCome take a romp through the forest and investigate all the clues that our native plants and wildlife leave behind! Soak up new knowledge about our native critters through hands-on exploration of their habitats. Learn about the different types of animal signs\, investigate what creatures make their home at Johnston Mill Nature Preserve\, and start to listen for\, look for\, and notice where they’ve been. This hike is best for ages 5+ and their adults. Please register all members of the family attending. This event is free\, but pre-registration is required:\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/get-wild-nature-detectives
LOCATION:Johnston Mill Preserve Secondary Entrance\, 6001 Turkey Farm Rd.\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
END:VEVENT
